The login/logout control disappeared because your custom `rest_framework/api.html` template overrides the `userlinks` block in `rest_framework/base.html`. The `userlinks` block contains the login/logout links by default.

To preserve the authentication links while adding your own content, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block in your template:

```html
{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
{% endblock %}
```

Using `{{ block.super }}` ensures that you add your links to the existing list rather than replacing the default content entirely.

